---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyProject
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard3 --> q_guard4: whenSaleEnded
    q_guard4 --> q_guard5: whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard5 --> q_verifyWithdraw: _verifyCanWithdrawCapital()
    q_verifyWithdraw --> q_markWithdrawn: s_saleStatus.capitalWithdrawn = true
    q_markWithdrawn --> q_calcFees: legionFee = capitalRaised * legionFeeRate / 10000
    q_calcFees --> q_calcRefFee: referrerFee = capitalRaised * referrerFeeRate / 10000
    q_calcRefFee --> q_calcNet: netCapital = capitalRaised - legionFee - referrerFee
    q_calcNet --> q_transferLegion: safeTransfer(legionFeeReceiver, legionFee)
    q_transferLegion --> q_transferReferrer: safeTransfer(referrerFeeDistributor, referrerFee)
    q_transferReferrer --> q_transferProject: safeTransfer(projectAdmin, netCapital)
    q_transferProject --> q_emit: emit CapitalWithdrawn(capitalRaised)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_verifyWithdraw
        INV-001: Capital can only be withdrawn once (capitalWithdrawn == false)
        INV-002: capitalRaised must have been published by Legion
    end note

    note right of q_calcFees
        INV-003: legionFee + referrerFee + netCapital == capitalRaised
        INV-004: Fee rates are in basis points (10000 = 100%)
    end note
